@page "/"

<PageTitle>CodeLogic</PageTitle>

<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="Start learning C# fundamentals with clear lessons, deterministic practice, and visual explanations." />
</HeadContent>

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="hero__content">
        <p class="eyebrow">Beginner-friendly C# learning</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">See how C# code thinks.</h1>
        <p class="hero__summary">
            Learn one concept at a time, practise with predictable feedback, and connect code to clear visual explanations.
        </p>
        <div class="button-row">
            <a class="button button--primary" href="/lessons">Explore lessons</a>
            <a class="button button--secondary" href="/playground">Preview the playground</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="hero__panel" aria-labelledby="learning-path-title">
        <p class="status-badge">Learning path preview</p>
        <h2 id="learning-path-title">Start with the fundamentals</h2>
        <ol class="step-list">
            <li><span>1</span> Read a focused lesson</li>
            <li><span>2</span> Check your understanding</li>
            <li><span>3</span> Visualize supported code</li>
        </ol>
    </aside>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="explore-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Application shell</p>
        <h2 id="explore-title">Choose where to begin</h2>
        <p>These areas are ready for navigation. Their learning features arrive in later reviewed tasks.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card-grid">
        <article class="feature-card">
            <p class="feature-card__label">Learn</p>
            <h3>Lessons</h3>
            <p>Follow an ordered path through C# fundamentals with clear objectives and examples.</p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/lessons">View lesson preview <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card">
            <p class="feature-card__label">Explore</p>
            <h3>Playground</h3>
            <p>See where supported snippets will become safe, deterministic visual explanations.</p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/playground">View playground preview <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card">
            <p class="feature-card__label">Reflect</p>
            <h3>Progress</h3>
            <p>Review completed lessons and practice attempts held temporarily in your current session.</p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/progress">View session progress <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section principles" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Designed for understanding</p>
        <h2 id="principles-title">Clear, predictable, and accessible</h2>
    </div>

    <ul class="principle-list">
        <li><strong>Small steps:</strong> one main concept at a time.</li>
        <li><strong>Deterministic feedback:</strong> the same answer receives the same explanation.</li>
        <li><strong>Keyboard friendly:</strong> core navigation works without a mouse.</li>
        <li><strong>No AI dependency:</strong> essential learning stays available without an AI service.</li>
    </ul>
</section>
